// Development and CI tools, pinned with go.sum hashes and kept up to date by
// Dependabot (ADR 0013). Not part of go.work: tool dependencies must not
// influence the versions resolved for the server, agent or shared modules.
//
// Install them all into $GOBIN:   cd tools && GOWORK=off go install tool
// Or run one without installing:  cd tools && GOWORK=off go tool <name>
//
// gosec is pinned to a pseudo-version (ADR 0013 exception): v2.29.0 bundles
// golang.org/x/tools v0.49.0, which cannot read the export data written by
// Go 1.27. Move back to a release tag (v2.30.0 or later, which bundles
// x/tools v0.52.0) once it is past the 7-day cooldown.
